        "created_at": "2015-03-25T13:31:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have so far been mercilessly beaten in the arena twice now with randomised teams (3 man and 4 man respectively).</p><p>I really like the mechanics of the arena but i think I need to assemble a team tailored to defeat it.</p><p>I was thinking lots of AoE damage to rack up fan points so Tempest and Sky Scraper leap to mind, but w<span>ho else would be good to round out a team to defeat this blasted arena?</span></p><p><span>I'm thinking Legacy for the extra damage buffs and maybe Scholar for tanking, but I tend to get stuck in my own playstyle so would like some suggestions I might not have thought of.</span></p>",
