        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-25T13:40:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Focus on what gets points. For example, if you have Tempest, his base power won't get points without a boost (which is where Legacy works well with him), and he can get some pretty sweet titles - which also gets points. Unlike other games, it's not about giving and taking hit points, so building a team here is a little different (e..g, huge amounts of damage&nbsp;<span>in one shot&nbsp;</span><span>aren't a big deal).</span></p>",
