&nbsp;Flak Jacket is best used to deny Warfang&#39;s big hit, a 2 point swing, and a well set up unload is a match winner. &nbsp;I&#39;ve topped 20 points in one turn 4 times with DW Expat. &nbsp;Her synergy with Mr. Fixer and Sky-Scraper is even more crazy in the arena.</p><p>My favorite team for an arena stompfest is that list minus Haka, it is just unfair how dominant they can be.</p>",
